---

## 6. Notes / gotchas

- Start with the craziness threshold conservative (7-8) and manually watch the first day or two of output before trusting it fully — tabloid "crazy" framing can drift into misleading or unverified claims fast.
- Some Slovak sites may rate-limit or block generic scrapers — set a normal browser `User-Agent` header.
- If Gemini free tier ever gets tight, Groq is the fallback (14.4K requests/day, add as a second provider with the same JSON-output prompt).
